          <tr><td>"Optional step 3" left unwritten</td><td>A refine loop that sends the code + errors back, capped at <code>MAX_REFINES</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Failure just printed</td><td>Raises an error with the reasons, so the caller knows the chain failed</td></tr>
